WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Omar Haddad: Expedited freight is still a disproportionate share of spend, mostly driven by late supplier releases.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Theo Marsh: Is that concentrated with one or two suppliers specifically?

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Omar Haddad: Mostly the fastener and packaging categories, both of which have ongoing corrective actions already.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Omar Haddad: The lane consolidation change is projected to save around seven percent once implemented.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Theo Marsh: Let's time the carrier renegotiation with the contract renewal next quarter.
